        "answer": {
          "short": "$(x+5)^2$",
          "worked": "$5+5=10$ and $5\\times5=25$.\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2+10x+25&=(x+5)(x+5)\\\\x^2+10x+25&=(x+5)^2\\end{align*}$$",
